[empty] NotPng: the data does not start with the PNG signature
[not png] NotPng: the data does not start with the PNG signature
[cut in IEND] Truncated: the data ends before the IEND chunk is complete
[cut in IHDR] Truncated: the data ends inside a chunk of 13 bytes
[bad crc] Checksum: the IDAT chunk fails its CRC-32
[depth] BadHeader: bit depth 4 is not allowed with color type 2
[ctype] BadHeader: color type 5 does not exist
[size] BadHeader: the size 0x2 is not positive
[interlace] BadHeader: interlace method 2 is not 0 or 1
[filter byte] Corrupt: row 0 has the unknown filter type 9
[short data] Truncated: the image data has 7 bytes, the header needs 14
[no idat] BadChunk: there is no IDAT chunk
[critical] Unsupported: the critical chunk ABCD is not known
[ancillary] ok 2x2
[no plte] BadChunk: a palette image has no PLTE chunk
[bad index] Corrupt: palette index 3 is outside the 2 entries of PLTE
[2nd ihdr] BadChunk: there is a second IHDR chunk
[not ihdr] BadChunk: the first chunk is tEXt, not IHDR
[bad zlib] Corrupt
